      "text": "all mankind were in lost and fallen state, 1 Ne. 10:6 (Alma 12:22; 42:14). devil sought misery of all mankind, 2 Ne. 2:18. Fall was cause of mankind becoming carnal, Mosiah 16:3. the Redeemer shall redeem all mankind who believe on his name, Alma 19:13. except for Atonement, all mankind must unavoidably perish, Alma 34:9. all mankind redeemed from first death, Hel. 14:16. Christ’s Resurrection redeems all mankind, Hel. 14:17. in Christ shall all mankind have life eternally, Ether 3:14.",
